    {
      "beat_id": "B10",
      "act": "LEVEL-2-MEMORY",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "That distinction isn't pedantry, it's the whole point. A memory you can open is a memory you can edit. In most products you can read the file, change a line, clear it, or switch the whole thing off.",
