    {
      "beat_id": "B11",
      "act": "LEVEL-2-MEMORY",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "Second door still swings both ways — but somebody set the latch before you got here. Depending on the product, memory is on by default or waiting to be switched on. That's a setting, and settings are checkable.",
