      "beat_id": "B13",
      "act": "LEVEL-3-PROVIDER",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "Your three facts sit in that machinery for a retention period. And here is the part worth saying plainly: the period is real, it's usually written down, and it is not yours.",
